Yuru original icons

Original SVG geometry authored for this repository; no third-party icon paths
or brand marks. Source is the templates directory, rendered by theme.py.

All artwork uses a 32-unit grid and transparent canvas. Mint folders, cream
documents, burgundy details, and square application frames share the Yuru
palette tokens. Internal relative symlinks provide MIME/name aliases without
duplicating source artwork. Small symbolic controls and application brands
fall back through Adwaita, AdwaitaLegacy, then hicolor.
